://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/icons/geo-alt.svg","fit":"cover"},{"id":"text_1","component":"Text","variant":"body","text":"### Bangalore to Langkawi Flights: April 15th\nMedia: Image=https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/icons/geo-alt.svg Icon=https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/icons/airplane.svg\nHere are some of the best flight options from Kempegowda International Airport (BLR) to Langkawi International Airport (LGK) for your travel on Monday, April 15th. Most flights include a single stop, typically in Kuala Lumpur (KUL).\n\n### One-Way Flight Options\nThe table below shows a selection of flights for your trip. Fares are estimates for one adult in economy class and are subject to change.\n\n| Airline | Departure | Arrival | Duration | Stops | Fare |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| AirAsia | 11:35 PM | 10:10 AM | 10h 05m | 1 stop | ₹11,850 |\n| Batik Air | 11:05 PM | 09:30 AM | 9h 55m | 1 stop | ₹13,200 |\n| Malaysia Airlines | 12:20 AM | 11:05 AM | 10h 15m | 1 stop | ₹17,550 |\n| AirAsia | 11:35 PM | 01:45 PM | 13h 40m | 1 stop | ₹10,990 |\n| Singapore Airlines | 11:10 PM | 12:30 PM | 12h 50m | 1 stop | ₹21,400 |\n\n### Destination Snapshot: Langkawi\n- Langkawi, the \"Jewel of Kedah,\" is an archipelago of 99 islands known for its stunning beaches, lush rainforests, and duty-free shopping.\n- Key attractions include the Langkawi Sky Bridge, Eagle Square (Dataran Lang), and numerous water sports activities at beaches like Pantai Cenang.\n- The local currency is the Malaysian Ringgit (MYR).\n\n### Quick Actions\nAction: [Button: Compare All Flights] https://www.google.com/flights#flt=BLR.LGK.2025-04-15;c:INR;e:1;s:1;sd:1;t:f\nAction: [Button: Langkawi Travel Guide] https://www.naturallylangkawi.my/\n\n### Sources\n- Flight Data: Google Flights, Skyscanner\n- Fares and Schedules: Respective airline websites as of the time of search."}]}}]' resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.sa